<title>USA: Delta adds to Atlanta/Indianopolis flights.</title>
<headline>Delta adds to Atlanta/Indianopolis flights.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Air Lines Inc said Thursday it would add two nonstop flights from Indianopolis to Atlanta, starting June 1. The company said that the flights were added as a response to increased demand, and that the company now offers six daily nonstop flights between the two cities.</p>
</text>
